"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"},". (This damage is added after the damage is multiplied for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"},".) However, on an attack roll that is a Natural 1, your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," deactivates and may not be reactivated until after the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
